{"hw":"πολέω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">πολέω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">πολέω</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">πέλω</span>) mostly Poet., <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">I</span> intr., <b class=\"lex-tr\">go about, range ouer, haunt,</b> <span class=\"gk\">νῆσον Αἴαντος πολεῖ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pers.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">307</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τί σὺ τῇδε πολεῖς;</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Alc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">29</span> </span> (anap.); <span class=\"gk\">τίς ὅδ' ἄρ' ἀμφὶ μέλαθρον πολεῖ;</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Or.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1270</span> </span> (lyr.):—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Med.</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">ὄψεις ἔννυχοι πολούμεναι ἐς παρθενῶνας</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">645</span> </span> (dub., leg. <span class=\"gk\">πωλεύμεναι</span>), cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Av.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">181</span> </span>: abs., <span class=\"gk\">πεφασμένως πολοῦνται</span> Lex <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Sol.</span> </span> ap. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lys.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10.19</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">revolve,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cra.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">405d</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> trans., <b class=\"lex-tr\">turn up</b> the earth with the plough, <b class=\"lex-tr\">plough,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἔαρι πολεῖν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hes.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Op.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">462</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">π. ἀρούρας</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Nic.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Al.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">245</span> </span>.</div></div>"}